Removed dependency
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Earlier revisions of this software computed oriented-bounding-box overlap with
CGAL (Computational Geometry Algorithms Library). CGAL's Boolean set operations
are distributed under the GNU General Public License, which is incompatible
with the Apache License 2.0 used here. That dependency has been removed and
replaced by an internal convex-polygon implementation
(`include/bag_modifier/geometry/polygon_iou.h`).
